   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Anna Lindh Euro-Mediterranean Foundation 2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Anna Lindh Foundation str&#xe4;var efter att utg&#xf6;ra ett instrument i dialogen mellan Europa och l&#xe4;nderna i s&#xf6;dra och &#xf6;stra medelhavet. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att bidra till politisk stabilitet, social utveckling och en &#xf6;kad respekt f&#xf6;r kulturell m&#xe5;ngfald genom att inr&#xe4;tta och st&#xf6;dja samarbete mellan regioner.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Anna Lindh Foundation strives to constitute an instrument in the dialogue between Europe and the countries in the Southern and East Mediterranean. The goal is to contribute to political stability, social development and an increased respect for cultural diversity by establishing and supporting cooperation between regions.</narrative>
  </description>
